WEBVTT

NOTE
Squall vs Seifer rematch. The two former Balamb Garden peers duel on Edea's moving parade float in the streets of Deling City. Their gunblades clash amid ornate decorations as Seifer fights to defend his new Sorceress. The float moves through the city streets as the battle rages. Duration: approximately 20 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall and Seifer clash on the parade float. Their gunblades meet with a loud metallic ring, sparks flying from the impact. The two men are evenly matched in stance and skill. The ornate float surrounds them, its decorative columns and structures visible in the background.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Seifer presses his attack, his gunblade slashing in a wide arc. Squall parries the blow, his movements precise and economical. Both fighters are breathing heavily. The float continues to move beneath their feet, adding an extra layer of difficulty to the duel.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Squall counters with a rapid strike. Seifer blocks and twists, using the momentum to push Squall backward. The clash of their blades creates a rhythmic pattern of metallic strikes. Citizens below scatter as the parade float moves past, unaware of the fierce combat happening atop it.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Seifer's expression is wild with intensity. His grey trench coat flares dramatically as he moves. His gunblade flashes in the evening light. His movements are confident and aggressive, reflecting his newfound purpose and allegiance to Edea.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Squall maintains his defensive posture, his leather jacket catching air as he repositions. His expression is grim and determined. He moves with controlled precision, every action deliberate. His eyes track Seifer's movements closely.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The two fighters exchange rapid strikes. The blades clash repeatedly in quick succession. Their duel is a mesmerizing display of skill and determination. The float's movement creates a surreal backdrop as they battle amid the city streets of Deling.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The final clash echoes across the city. Both fighters separate momentarily. The float continues its journey through Deling City, carrying the battling warriors onward through the streets. The duel remains unresolved as the scene transitions.
